msgid "Description"
msgstr ""

msgid "ONE FILE of a resource (E.D. 2026-09-30, «la risorsa e i suoi file»): the ResourceNode is the SET — the handle a person stamps, cites and opens, with name, kind, scope, residency, role, tier, packaging and rights — and the ResourceFileNode is each member: an obj, its mtl and its textures are three files of one resource. Reached by has\\_file (reverse is\\_file\\_of); the ROLE (entry\\_point \\| member) and the RELATIVE PATH travel on the EDGE, because the same file (a corrected texture) sits in N resources under N paths. With ONE file the node is IMPLICIT: a ResourceNode with url (and checksum) and no has\\_file is a resource of one file, and s3dgraphy.resources.files.resource\\_files shows that file anyway; the node is written only when there are several files or the one file has a stamp or an identity of its own. Fields: url (a path, a file:// / s3:// / http(s):// URI or a blend:// locator), checksum ('sha256:<hex>'; 'emstruct1:<hex>' for a datablock, comparable not verifiable), size\\_bytes, media\\_type. For a datablock blend\\_file and datablock are READ from the blend:// locator (resources/resolver.py, the one place that knows its form), never stored twice. The same file in several resources is ONE node, recognised by its checksum."
msgstr ""

msgid "*Italiano*: UN FILE di una risorsa (E.D. 30 set 2026, «la risorsa e i suoi file»): il ResourceNode è l'INSIEME — la maniglia che si timbra, si cita e si apre — e il ResourceFileNode è ogni membro: un obj, il suo mtl e le sue texture sono tre file di una risorsa sola. Raggiunto da has\\_file; il RUOLO (entry\\_point \\| member) e il PERCORSO RELATIVO stanno sull'ARCO, perché lo stesso file sta in più risorse con percorsi diversi. Con UN file il nodo è IMPLICITO: url e checksum restano sul ResourceNode. Per un datablock blend\\_file e datablock si leggono dal locator blend://, mai scritti due volte."
msgstr ""

